{"abstract":[{"text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A wallet holding real credentials is only as trustworthy as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform it runs on. The package enforces some of this itself: without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", receiving credentials needs a key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store and a credential store that both say they’re durable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), and services on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loopback addresses are refused. The rest is the app’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Keys-and-storage","text":"Keys and storage","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":"’s defaults: keys in the Secure Enclave,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"persistent, and holder keys asking for Face ID, Touch ID or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode before each presentation. Add "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Info.plist."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":": complete data protection, out of backups."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is for tests."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" at launch, before any issuance,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so keys an interrupted issuance left don’t accumulate."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make one "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" per key store and credential store, and share it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the app’s life. Two over the same stores don’t coordinate: both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could present the same copy of a credential, so Verifiers could link"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentations, or redeem the same refresh token, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization server revokes the grant."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A device restored from a backup has no holder keys: its credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent"},{"type":"text","text":" as false and can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented. Delete them, and receive them again."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"anchor":"The-Wallet-Provider","text":"The Wallet Provider","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers trust the wallet because its Wallet Provider attests it. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"production Wallet Provider should attest a wallet and its keys only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app on a genuine device, and should keep its own signing key in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HSM. The demo wallet’s provider attests anything, and is for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"development only."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Trust","text":"Trust","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure only your ecosystem’s roots: "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/issuerRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for credentials, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifiers the wallet answers, and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only for registrars, never for Verifiers or issuers, which could then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register themselves."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For readers, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"type":"text","text":" where every reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must be a known one."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Never ship with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development"},{"type":"text","text":" set."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To pin your services’ certificates, set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/tlsPins"},{"type":"text","text":": host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificate’s SubjectPublicKeyInfo. Pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin: a wrong set locks the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet out of that host until an update. Pins cover the SDK’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requests, which "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPinnedDomains"},{"type":"text","text":" doesn’t reach, not your app’s, such"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as to your Wallet Provider: pin that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession"},{"type":"text","text":" yourself."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Privacy","text":"Privacy","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Request batches of copies ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize"},{"type":"text","text":") and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh them as they’re used up ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so presentations stay unlinkable; warn the holder when one wouldn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Log "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/message"},{"type":"text","text":", never claims or credentials."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"anchor":"The-build","text":"The build","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ship the release build of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":", which the package links by default."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Refuse to run on the test build, which carries an in-process issuer and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifier: check "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" at launch."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"A-document-provider-extension","text":"A document provider extension","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app and its extension each update a credential’s record — marking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a copy presented, replacing copies on refresh — with a lock that spans"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only their own process. Refresh credentials when the app becomes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"active, not while it’s in the background, so the two don’t write the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same record at once."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"Going to production","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)":{"title":"sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","abstract":[{"text":"Deletes every key in ","type":"text"},{"code":"keyStore","type"